#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:26
msgid " GSOC Ideas List"
msgstr " GSoC 创意列表"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:5 c2467ace079a4e559c29d66f57d9230b
msgid "GSoC - Google Summer of Code"
msgstr "GSoC - 谷歌代码之夏"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:6 2586489b50394d5f92f5731ca7e2f8bb
msgid ""
"Each year, ArduPilot participates in the `Google Summer of Code program "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__,  encouraging students and others "
"to contribute to the ArduPilot code base."
msgstr ""
"每年，ArduPilot 都会参与 `谷歌代码之夏项目 "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__，鼓励学生和其他人向 ArduPilot 代码库贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:8 32e33188c6bb4d3390d8df70ef8e8a0f
msgid ""
"The development team includes experienced mentors who will help students "
"make great contributions to ArduPilot."
msgstr "开发团队包含经验丰富的导师，将帮助学生为 ArduPilot 做出出色的贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:10 2c031db444b24c8eb34865bc031da5a2
msgid "To help you get started:"
msgstr "帮助您入门的资源："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:12 f78a98169d1c404392f5982d95debac1
msgid ""
"The `timeline for GSoC 2025 is here <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"
msgstr ""
"`GSoC 2025 的时间表在此 <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:13 2344f1c75b94401daabc394e229c05bc
msgid ""
"The :ref:`suggested projects list is here <gsoc-ideas-list>`. This is a list"
" of our ideas of what would be good to work on but we are open to other "
"suggestions you make in your application."
msgstr ""
":ref:`建议项目列表在此 <gsoc-ideas-list>`。这是我们认为值得开展的项目创意列表，但我们也欢迎您在申请中提出其他建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:14 a9e9375e147d4f8e8c15305be02a78d6
msgid ""
"The #GSOC channel in the `ArduPilot Discord server "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ is a good place to ask questions about "
"our GSOC program, submit ideas for projects, etc. Mentors will respond to "
"your posts in this GSoC channel."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot Discord 服务器 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 中的 #GSOC 频道是询问 "
"GSoC 项目问题、提交项目创意等的好地方。导师将在该 GSoC 频道中回复您的帖子。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:15 65b7faa2f5604c039c9c6cbd9d13de09
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>` and, specifically, the "
":ref:`ArduPilot Developers Wiki <dev:home>` are good sources of information "
"on ArduPilot and how to contribute to its code."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>`，尤其是 :ref:`ArduPilot 开发者 Wiki "
"<dev:home>`，是了解 ArduPilot 及如何贡献代码的良好信息来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:17 c664af81253d4e8596ca8dcb6ed4cd39
msgid ""
"Please note that there are likely to be more students applying than we will "
"have places allocated by Google, so to improve your chances please include:"
msgstr "请注意，申请人数可能超过 Google 分配给我们的名额，因此请在申请中包含以下内容以提高成功率："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:19 b03e6492b8094efd809b0022d628b16a
msgid ""
"Information on how you would approach the project, what time you can put "
"into it and what you think you can achieve over the GSoC period"
msgstr "说明您将如何推进项目、可投入的时间，以及您认为在 GSoC 期间能实现的成果"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:20 03b18a13c37149f48f8682a95d4e2c24
msgid ""
"Experience with the tools you will need to complete the project (eg. "
"demonstrated ability in the relevant programming language or environment)"
msgstr "完成项目所需工具的使用经验（例如，在相关编程语言或环境中的能力证明）"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:21 3159e816bcd942bca15ee874668b63c0
msgid "Details of past open-source projects you have contributed to"
msgstr "您曾经贡献过的开源项目的详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:22 c06f3fec257744afad8c1c58f7540387
msgid "Enthusiasm for your chosen project"
msgstr "对所选项目的热情"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:24 245c33f62763463db8afd58de6092b7b
msgid ""
"Please feel free to post your ideas, or if you have more general questions, "
"contact the mentors on our GSoC Discord channel referenced above."
msgstr "欢迎随时发布您的想法，或者如有一般性问题，请通过上述 GSoC Discord 频道联系导师。"
